WEBVTT

00:10:58.779 --> 00:11:01.990
and I ended up living on drill rigs.

00:11:02.616 --> 00:11:05.327
And I had a complete epiphany,

00:11:05.369 --> 00:11:07.287
it was a total mind shift,

00:11:07.287 --> 00:11:09.206
bias out the door.

00:11:09.707 --> 00:11:14.211
Because I got to know many individuals
in the oil and gas workforce.

00:11:14.795 --> 00:11:16.380
And y'all that grit.

00:11:16.422 --> 00:11:18.424
I mean, it is incredible grit.

00:11:18.882 --> 00:11:20.801
Those people are there for it.

00:11:21.218 --> 00:11:25.305
But I also got to know
the amazing technological innovations

00:11:25.305 --> 00:11:26.932
of that industry.

00:11:26.974 --> 00:11:31.061
And what I've come to believe
is those are assets.